splitwire-turkey (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Linux
  * GTK4/Libadwaita user interface
  * WireGuard VPN with WGCF/WARP integration
  * Split tunneling support via cgproxy
  * Zapret DPI bypass (nfqws/tpws)
  * ByeDPI proxy integration
  * DNS management with DoH support
  * Discord repair tools
  * Multi-language support (tr, en, ru, es)
  * systemd service integration

 -- SplitWire Team <splitwire@example.com>  Sat, 07 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0300
